<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Alliance boosts inferred resource.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Alliance boosts inferred resource.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alliance Gold Mines NL said on Thursday it had increased its gold resource to 120,000 ounces by defining a new inferred resource of about 50,000 ounces in the Eaglehawk Reef at the Alliance South prospect in Victoria.</p>
<p>The new inferred resource comprises about 140,000 tonnes at an estimated grade of 11 grams of gold a tonne, it said.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
